# GitHub language statistics (Linguist).
#
# Linguist measures bytes per language, not the value of the code. The BMad Method tooling
# that lives next to the product (.agents/skills, _bmad runtime scripts) and the artifacts it
# renders (planning decks, brain-selector assets) dwarf the C# sources, so the language bar
# reported Python/HTML instead of C#. These files stay in the repository and in the file tree;
# they are only taken out of the language statistics.
#
#   linguist-vendored       installed/third-party tooling that is copied into the repository
#   linguist-documentation  prose and generated artifacts, never product code
#
# Verify with: git check-attr linguist-vendored linguist-documentation -- <path>
.agents/**       linguist-vendored
_bmad/**         linguist-vendored
_bmad-output/**  linguist-documentation

# Already detected as documentation by Linguist's own heuristic (docs/, doc/); stated
# explicitly so the statistics do not depend on heuristic changes.
docs/**          linguist-documentation
